            "cited": true,
            "measurable": true,
            "method": "semantic",
            "support": 0.0,
            "supported": false
          },
          {
            "text": "[1][2] 摘录指出 Last-Event-ID 请求头在用户代理重新建立连接时向服务器报告 EventSource 对象的 last event ID 字符串。",
            "cited": true,
